## Run 3: slot 11, 1000 mL, 2.2 bar, aborted by hand (before the stall fix)

Same filter as run 2, after it had run for a while. The flowmeter count went flat at 516–517 mL for about 200 s while the pump kept running and pausing; the stall rule did not fire, because every pause restarted its window (F149). Stopped with a key.

    fill_test ended: aborted, 517 mL (flowmeter) in 763 s, P max 2.91 bar, 139 pause(s)
